  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Int, +1 Con\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Nature, Survival\nLava Release Affinity: You begin with either Earth or Fire Release Affinity. (Pick one)\nLava Techniques: The Yoton clan has access to a separate list of jutsu unique to their clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the normal jutsu list(s). They do not need both nature releases to use their clan jutsu.\nHijutsu Flexibility: Futton Clan Hijutsu can use either Intelligence or Constitution as its casting ability score.\nThermal Acclimation: You have advantage on checks made to resist extreme heat environments.\nThermal Attunement: You can sense sources of heat such as fire, lava, or any substance whose heat could burn. You become aware of them and can track them down to their location within 120 feet of you, even through walls up to 1 foot thick.\n[BOX]\n| #### Molten Terrain / Special Terrain / Molten Terrain. Creatures attempting to move through a space marked as Molten terrain, every foot of movement in that space costs 1 extra foot. This effect is cumulative with difficult terrain and other special terrains. |\n[/BOX]",
